SUMMARY:Pop-up Native Plant Nursery at the Montclair Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Hope Grows Nursery is a seasonal pop-up native plant nursery offering native plant plugs\, professionally designed garden kits\, and life-size rollout planting templates that make ecological gardening simple and approachable for homeowners. \nDesigned for northern New Jersey yards\, the curated garden kits take the guesswork out of planting with combinations selected for bloom succession\, deer resistance\, structure\, and ecological value. Customers can shop individual plants or order online for market pickup. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/pop-up-native-plant-nursery-at-the-montclair-farmers-market/2026-06-13/
LOCATION:Montclair Farmers Market\, 86 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
