SUMMARY:Psychedelic Connection Circle
DESCRIPTION:This is a space for real conversation—honest\, curious\, and human. \nWe’ll gather in a small group setting to explore the role psychedelics have played (or may play) in our lives. Through guided prompts and open dialogue\, you’ll have the opportunity to reflect\, share\, and hear from others navigating similar questions around healing\, meaning\, and transformation. \nSome of what we may explore: \n– How psychedelic experiences have impacted your sense of self\, spirituality\, or direction\n– What integration actually looks like in real life—not just in theory\n– Navigating difficult or destabilizing experiences\n– The tension between inner transformation and outer life (family\, community\, culture)\n– Information sharing on different psychedelics and their effects \nYou’re welcome whether you have years of experience or you’re simply curious and want to listen and learn. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/psychedelic-connection-circle/
LOCATION:Yoga Mechanics\, 107 Forest Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community,General Events,Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-05-16-at-9.21.29-AM.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Journey Together":MAILTO:jeanielorretta@gmail.com
